// Locator console: 23,126 and 498 by 313. Child positions are relative to that
// panel. The player search is the one shown: its icon is lit, and PAGE is up.
// The panel draws no picture of its own, so the green console layer shows
// through it. The name field and the results are outlined in palette 90; the
// divider and the rule under the headings are palette 93.
